          <div class="kicker">Practice & Team Management</div>
          <h2>Run your office, not just your adjusting room.</h2>
          <p class="section-copy">Role-based access so everyone sees exactly what they should — and nothing they shouldn't.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <div class="feature-item"><strong>Provider profiles</strong> — professional name, license number, NPI, and contact info. Each provider has their own schedule, lunch breaks, time off, and macros.</div>
          <div class="feature-item"><strong>Staff accounts</strong> — scheduling, patient management, and front desk tools. Clinical notes are out of scope — by design.</div>
          <div class="feature-item"><strong>Employee onboarding</strong> — add a new team member and GRIT auto-generates their account, sets a temporary password, and sends an invite. They set their own password on first login.</div>
          <div class="feature-item"><strong>HIPAA form customization</strong> — edit the text for all three HIPAA consent sections or use GRIT's professionally written defaults.</div>
